  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WAN-IFRA Stronger Together! Media and Democracy Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x201C;Stronger Together! Media and Democracy Programme&#x201D; aims to enhance the capacity of Ukrainian CSOs and media to strengthen civil society and democratic institutions through financially resilient, networked, investigative-minded, gender-equal, and inclusive independent regional and local media. The method consists of four pillars: capacity building through training and mentoring, provision of subgrants, fostering investigative journalism, and promoting gender equality and inclusivity within media organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
